Z||000005||p4n1c||02-18-2001||01:51 PM||||I went out and picked up a Palm IIIx, it was cheap and has been cool so far.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Question though, do I need a modem to connect up to the net using a cell or can I use just a datacable?  The thing is I have a non-GSM phone, it's Rogers Nokia 6160 using TDMA.<P><B>Edit:</B> Nevermind, I need the Rogers Portage stuff.  It uses my phones data capability to act as a modem.  $100 CDN later.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)<p>[This message has been edited by p4n1c (edited 02-18-2001).]||||reg||1
